DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma Feel a dazzling rush of cinematic vitality and dark humor as a young ma
 n (Harvey Keitel)\, split between the rough world around him and his spiri
 tual nature\, tries to keep his loose cannon friend (Robert De Niro) and h
 is girlfriend (Amy Robinson) safe from street toughs and Mob bosses. Inspi
 red by Scorsese’s Little Italy background.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progr
 ams-and-events/martin-scorsese/mean-streets\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
